config BR2_PACKAGE_ASCENT_LITE_FFS
	bool "ascent-lite-ffs"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  FunctionFS (usb_f_fs.ko) for the Ascent Lite and Lite+, whose
	  stock kernel has the USB gadget's configfs but not FunctionFS:
	  the kernel's own f_fs.c, built as a module against the image's
	  kernel tree (the stock kernel's version and vermagic). fpvOS_usb's
	  bridge mode loads it.
